        "title": "Configure Container Cleaning",
        "description": "Set up your container cleaning integration.\n\nProvider: Select the data source. Choose 'manual' when your cleaning service has no API; you then provide a JSON or iCal (.ics) file, or an iCal URL, with the cleaning dates.",
