        "description": "Postal code: Postal code for the service address.\nHouse number: House number for the service address.\nStreet name: Street name or suffix used by your provider.\nExclude today's cleaning: When enabled, sensors ignore cleaning scheduled for today and show the next cleaning after today.\nUse ISO date format: Show timestamps in ISO format where applicable.\nContainer type exclude list: Comma-separated container types to ignore (for example: gft,pmd).",
        "data": {
          "postal_code": "Postal code",
